"quantity_max": null, "unit": null, "item": "finely grated zest of 2 oranges", "preparation": null, "optional": false}], "steps": [{"position": 1, "text": "In a large bowl, combine the sugar, baking soda, salt and egg. Beat until the sugar begins to dissolve and the mixture is very glossy, about 10 minutes. Set aside."}, {"position": 2, "text": "In another bowl, use a pastry cutter to combine the butter with the flour until it resembles coarse meal. Slowly stir the milk into the sugar mixture and strain it through a sieve into the flour and butter. Add the caraway seeds and zest, stirring until the mixture is just combined."}, {"position": 3, "text": "Using your hands, divide the dough into 4 balls of equal size. Wrap each in plastic wrap and allow them to chill for at least 1 hour in the refrigerator. (The balls may be formed into logs about 2 inches in diameter, wrapped well in plastic and frozen for up to 1 month.)"}, {"position": 4, "text": "When ready to bake, preheat the oven to 325 degrees. Remove one of the balls of dough from the refrigerator and, on a lightly floured surface, roll the dough out to a thickness of about 16 inch. Using a 2-inch oval or round cookie cutter, cut out as many cookies as possible, reworking the scraps as you go. (If the dough is frozen, use a sharp knife to cut the logs into thin slices.)"}, {"position": 5, "text": "Transfer the cookie dough to ungreased baking sheets and bake until they are lightly golden and crisp, about 12 to 15 minutes. Cool on a wire rack. Repeat with the remaining dough balls, or save, refrigerated, for up to 3 days."}], "nutrition": {"calories": 74.2, "protein_g": 1.2, "carbohydrates_g": 12.1, "fat_g": 2.4, "saturated_fat_g": 1.4, "trans_fat_g": 0.0, "cholesterol_mg": 7.6, "sodium_mg": 36.5, "fiber_g": 0.4, "sugar_g": 4.4, "unsaturated_fat_g": 0.8, "source": "nyt", "basis": "per_serving", "computed_with": null}, "tags": {"cuisine": ["american"], "diet": [], "course": ["dessert"], "meal": [], "occasion": ["new year’s day"], "other": ["all-purpose flour", "bake", "butter", "egg", "light brown sugar", "milk", "orange"]}, "images": [], "rating": null, "video_url": null, "comment_count": null, "published_at": "1998-10-11", "scraped_at": "2026-09-07T08:26:00.439064+00:00", "scraper_version": "1.0.0"}
